WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:03.090
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.610
Dr. Bright! Stop calling people peasants!

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:11.010
We are living in the modern world, Jack.&nbsp;
Feudalism is long over. The D-Class,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:16.770
the interns, the Research Assistants, none of&nbsp;
these people are peasants. Stop calling them that!

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.010
Also, let's be honest, if we&nbsp;
were living in Medieval times,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:24.210
you probably wouldn't be a&nbsp;
lord. You'd be the court jester.

